-- R11b trigger fixes: SPEECH / SPEECH_TO gates use legacy word-boundary matching (word list = whole words, phrase = whole phrase), 123:14 megalith keepers treat an unset quest var as 0
-- APPLY AFTER 2026-10-15-r11-trigger-fixes.sql: the md5 guards are the bodies that patch writes (fierylib 6a82af3)
--
-- Idempotent: a row already holding the new body is left alone, so rerunning
-- updates nothing. Keyed by the composite primary key (zone_id, id).
-- Guarded: a row is only touched while it still holds the previous committed
-- body (md5), so rows edited in Muditor since then are left alone.

BEGIN;

UPDATE "Triggers" AS t
SET commands = v.commands,
    updated_at = now()
FROM (VALUES
